Modifications (2026-11-05):

- Added Windows desktop build support (Visual Studio 2022 Build Tools,
  Windows SDK, ATL, CMake, NuGet).
- Added local-first mode: login and subscription entry points are hidden,
  first-run onboarding is skipped, and community collection / podcast
  enrollment work without an account.
- Added a custom OpenAI-compatible AI configuration (Base URL, API key,
  model) for translation, sentence analysis, sense groups, AI dictionary
  lookups and the AI assistant.
- Added a media_kit-based just_audio playback bridge for Windows.
- Added Windows build fixes: /utf-8 compile option, configurable install
  prefix, and WebView2Loader.dll installation.

